# Insurance Cost Analysis using Python

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes an insurance dataset to understand how different factors like age, BMI, and smoking habits affect medical charges.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib

## 📊 Key Analysis
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Impact of smoking on insurance charges
- Relationship between age and charges

## 📈 Visualizations
- Bar chart: Smoker vs Non-Smoker charges
- Scatter plot: Age vs Charges

## 🔍 Key Insights
- Smokers have significantly higher insurance charges
- Charges increase with age
- BMI also impacts insurance cost

## 📁 Dataset
Insurance dataset containing:
- Age
- Sex
- BMI
- Children
- Smoker
- Region
- Charges

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Run the script:
   python src/analysis.py
